  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the lardons and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the canned tomatoes, kale, salt, and red wine vinegar.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Add the serrano ham and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot.",
    "Garnish with additional kale, if desired."
